ltc_code (https://github.com/selfshadow/ltc_code, commit 31e5e96b54f98f33098f8503003119ba2231a1c6)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

In quench_render: the fitted LTC tables of fit/results/ltc.js (src/render/LtcTable.inc, written by
tools/make_ltc_table.py) and the area light integrals of webgl/shaders/ltc/ltc_quad.fs, ltc_disk.fs and ltc_line.fs,
ported to HLSL in shaders/quench/AreaLights.hlsli. Reference:

  Real-Time Polygonal-Light Shading with Linearly Transformed Cosines.
  Eric Heitz, Jonathan Dupuy, Stephen Hill and David Neubelt.
  ACM Transactions on Graphics (Proceedings of ACM SIGGRAPH 2016) 35(4), 2016.
  Project page: https://eheitzresearch.wordpress.com/415-2/

